            "Goal thought ko positive lie se replace karna nahi. ‘Main best hoon’ believable nahi hoga. Better: ‘Criticism hurt hui; iska matlab whole identity failure nahi. Main next task define kar sakta hoon.’ Urge ko bhi fact vs command mein separate karo: ‘Mera body/attention sexual escape chahta hai; main ten minutes observe kar sakta hoon.’ Practice low-intensity moments mein karo taaki high-intensity moment mein sequence familiar ho.",
