            "Aapka chosen boundary abstinence ho ya controlled behaviour, delay informed choice ko space deta hai. However, if controlled masturbation repeatedly becomes multi-hour loss of control, then temporarily stronger boundaries with therapist support may be useful. If complete abstinence creates obsessive panic, counting and shame, then goal itself needs review. There is no one-size-fits-all rule. Measure whether the plan increases agency and functioning without creating new harm.",
