            "Mindfulness yahan explicit imagination nahi, present-moment attention hai: feet, sounds, breath, texture, ordinary task. Grounding ko ritual mat banao jise repeatedly perform karna compulsory ho jaaye. Flexible skills better. Agar particular memories/trauma trigger ho rahe hain, toh trauma-informed therapist support lo. You are not required to disclose graphic detail to friends or support groups; a qualified clinician can work with non-graphic description and safety needs.",
