            "Agar pattern loneliness, rejection, boredom, performance anxiety, relationship conflict, depression, trauma, or work stress se closely linked hai, toh blockers alone incomplete honge. Need ko name karo: connection, rest, comfort, achievement, autonomy, reassurance, or escape. Phir us need ke two non-compulsive responses choose karo. Loneliness = safe conversation/community; stress = task breakdown/therapy; boredom = engaging activity; exhaustion = sleep routine; relationship conflict = structured communication/counselling.",
            "Alternative immediately same intensity of relief na de, tab bhi worthwhile hai. You are building a broader coping system, not finding a new instant anaesthetic. If depression, anxiety, bipolar symptoms, OCD, ADHD, trauma, or substance use co-exist, integrated treatment can matter. Antons et al. review and related clinical work CSBD ko other disorders ke context mein assess karne par stress karte hain. Treating the whole person is not a bonus; it is often central.",
