            "Treatment may include psychoeducation, motivational work, CBT, ACT/mindfulness skills, relapse prevention, co-occurring disorder treatment, relationship work, and sometimes specialist-prescribed medication. Medication often off-label in CSBD context; evidence not same as substance-specific approved treatments. Ask about risks, alternatives and review. You can seek second opinion from a qualified professional if plan feels unsafe or shaming. Improvement may be gradual; each reduction in impairment and increase in choice matters.",
