            "Agar urges kisi non-consensual, illegal, exploitative ya minor-involving direction mein ja rahi hain, toh immediately distance, barriers and urgent qualified professional/legal help lo. Potential victim ki safety priority hai. Is book mein aise behaviour ko manage karne ke techniques nahi diye gaye; specialist risk assessment chahiye. If someone is in immediate danger, call emergency services. Healthy recovery never treats another person as a coping tool.",
