            "Agar relationship affected hai, toh conversation calm, non-intoxicated moment mein karo. Structure: concrete facts without unnecessary graphic detail, impact, responsibility, current plan, and what support you are requesting. Example: ‘Late-night porn use se sleep aur hamara time affected hua hai. Main therapy aur device boundaries start kar raha hoon. Main tumse monitoring nahi, but agreed check-in chahta hoon.’ Partner ko hurt, angry, cautious ya unwilling to participate feel hone ka right hai.",
            "Disclosure ka scope safety, health, agreements and professional guidance ke hisaab se decide hota hai. STI risk, shared finances, consent violations, or safety issues involved hon toh relevant disclosure and professional/legal support important hai. Graphic details trauma create kar sakte hain and recovery ke liye necessary nahi. Couples therapist structured conversation mein help kar sakta hai. Partner ka role detective, parent or 24/7 blocker banana automatic nahi.",
