            "Relationships mein masturbation/porn ke views vary karte hain. Koi behaviour apne aap mein universally ‘cheating’ ya ‘not cheating’ label se settle nahi hota; agreements, consent, honesty and impact matter karte hain. Dono partners apne boundaries express kar sakte hain, but boundaries coercion nahi ban sakti. Agreement specific ho: kya acceptable, kya private, kya shared expectation, kya digital/financial limit, and what happens if agreement breaks.",
            "Agreement mein punishment, forced access to all passwords, public exposure, sexual obligation, or threats include nahi hone chahiye. ‘If you loved me you would never have desire’ unrealistic. Better: ‘We agree no work-time porn and no paid content; if lapse happens, we discuss impact and review support.’ If partners’ values fundamentally differ, counselling can clarify compatibility. Separation may be a valid choice; no one owes staying in a harmful dynamic.",
