            "If monitoring is used, it should be consensual, time-limited, reviewable, minimally invasive, and paired with skill-building. Either person can request revision. If there is fear, violence, coercive control or retaliation, monitoring plan unsafe ho sakta hai; specialist domestic-safety support priority. Recovery must not become another arena for abuse. Professional couples work should screen for safety, not push joint sessions blindly.",
