            "Compulsion ke baad body se disconnection, performance anxiety, touch avoidance, or sex ko test banane ka pressure ho sakta hai. Recovery mein sexual performance ko immediate target banana counterproductive ho sakta hai. Start with non-sexual connection: conversation, shared meals, walk, hobbies, appreciation, and affection only where mutually comfortable. No expectation that affection must lead to sex. This reduces pressure and makes consent clearer.",
