            "Repair sirf sorry nahi; acknowledgement, responsibility, safety, restitution where relevant, consistent behaviour and respect for the other person’s pace hai. ‘Maine relapse kar liya, tumhe forgive karna chahiye’ pressure hai. Better: ‘Maine agreement toda; impact tum par bhi hai. Maine yeh steps liye hain; tum jo boundary decide karte ho usse respect karunga, and professional support continue karunga.’ Forgiveness ko demand nahi kiya ja sakta.",
